OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: BBC Radio London's Eddie
OL,4,ANestor speaks to TfL about photocard
OL,5,Abreach
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe personal details of about 265,000
OL,8,FOyster photocard customers have been
OL,9,Faccessed in a cyber breach, Transport
OL,10,Ffor London says
OL,12,FNames, email and home addresses, phone
OL,13,Fnumbers, dates of birth and security
OL,14,Fquestions and answers were compromised
OL,15,Fafter "suspicious activity" was
OL,16,Fdetected on the photocard website on
OL,17,FMonday
OL,19,FShashi Verma, TfL's director of
OL,20,Ftechnology strategy and revenue, will
OL,21,Fbe speaking to BBC Radio London's Eddie
OL,22,FNestor about what has happened
OL,23,APub: UnavailableQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
